  "content": "<html><body>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hi9moJH.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><strong>&laquo; MODDED COMPATIBILITY v3.10.1 &raquo;</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>社群貢獻也歡迎！只需 <a href=\"https://github.com/vizthex123/StonebornModdedCompat/pulls\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">開發Pull Request</a>，您的UI便可加入素材包並獲完全署名。</em></h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>您也可以在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fNtwzA6X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">discord 伺服器</a>上請求支援或回報問題。</em></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><em><strong>&laquo; 請查看 STONEBORN 包（必備）&raquo;</strong></em></span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/673/ui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"156\" height=\"156\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">&laquo; 7m &raquo; 下載量。感謝，由衷感謝。入選 &laquo; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/medieval-mc-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Medieval MC [FABRIC]</a> &raquo;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/medieval-mc-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/489/55/medievallogo.png\" width=\"244\" height=\"76\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" height=\"32\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">.fsh shader。現在所有 GUI 標題和容器標題均為橘色/金色。最大相容性！</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">如需預設字體，請刪除 .fsh shader</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hOSFIUm.png\" width=\"274\" height=\"390\"></span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><em>請享受 STONEBORN 對超過 200 個模組的重新紋理，包括 Create、Quark、JEI、REI、AE2、Biomancy、Sophisticated Backpacks、Iron Chests、Curios、Trinkets 等等！</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">在評論區或 <a href=\"https://github.com/vizthex123/StonebornModdedCompat/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a> 中提出新增請求。</span></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">&laquo; 支援的模組 &raquo;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<em>如需完整支援模組列表 --&gt; <strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/vizthex123/StonebornModdedCompat/blob/main/CFAssets/supported_mods.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此處</a>. </strong>&lt;--</em></p>\n</body></html><ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorn-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span 